  "card": "Adds explicit `#include <util/check.h>` and drops `<cassert>` across unit test, benchmark, and fuzz files via a scripted-diff. This prevents compile errors when compiling without assertions in `util/check.h`, clarifies that assertions will not be stripped by `NDEBUG`, and facilitates automated IWYU analysis. It also permits `clang-format` inside CI scripted-diff checks to sort modified include blocks.",
